 139+ 7573              // Any new vocabulary is structured as follow:
 140+ 7573              // PFA+0 points to DOES> part of VOCABULARY to perform CELL+ CONTEXT !
 141+ 7573              // PFA+2 is 81,A0 i.e. a null-word used as LATEST in the new vocabulary
