 143+ 7573              //       at creations it points to the null-word of its parent vocabulary
 144+ 7573              //       that is normally FORTH, For example ASSEMBLER points FORTH's null-word
 145+ 7573              // PFA+6 is the pointer that builds up the vocabulary linked list.
 146+ 7573              //       FORTH has 0 here to signal the end of the list and user's variable
 147+ 7573              //       VOC-LINK points to PFA+6 of the newest vocabulary created.
 148+ 7573              //       While FORTH is the only vocabulary, VOC-LINK points to FORTH's PFA+6
 149+ 7573              //       When ASSEMBLER is created, its PFA+6 points to FORTH's PFA+6, and so on
